AlkylationReagent: acrylamide
CellLine: ExpiCHO-S cells
CleavageAgent: sequencing grade porcine trypsin
CleavageAgent: bovine chymotrypsin
CleavageAgent: endoproteinase Glu-C from Staphylococcus aureus V8
FlowRateChromatogram: 5 microL/min
FragmentMassTolerance: 0.1 Da
FragmentationMethod: collision induced dissociation (CID)
GradientTime: 5-35% solution B (6 min)
GradientTime: 5-35% solution B over 22 min
Instrument: ZenoTOF 7600 mass spectrometer (SCIEX)
Modification: Propionamide at cysteine
Modification: Oxidation at methionine
Modification: deamidation of asparagine
NumberOfMissedCleavages: two missed cleavages
PrecursorMassTolerance: 20 ppm
ReductionReagent: dithiothreitol
Separation: Waters nanoEase M/Z HSS T3 C18 column (300 microm x 150 mm, 1.8 microm, 100 Aa)
